# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Without this, files rewritten by PowerShell here-strings / Out-File come back
# as CRLF and show up as fully-rewritten in diffs even when nothing changed --
# app/db/migrations.py and 002_repair_existing_schema.sql each showed ~70 lines
# of churn with zero real edits, which hides genuine changes during review.
#
# Existing files are only renormalized when they are next touched. To convert
# the whole tree in one deliberate commit, run:  git add --renormalize .
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
